"<h1>Network configuration</h1><p>This module allows you to configure your "
"TCP/IP settings.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Nettwark-Instellen</h1><p>Mit dit Moduul kannst Du Dien TCP/IP-Instellen "
"ännern.</p>"

